Ek Diya Koi Jalade Shaam Ke Zindan Me<br>
<br>
1.Khakh Ke Bistar Pe Mujh Ku Neend Kaise Aayegi<br>
Khoon Aankhou Se Sakina Har Ghadi Barsayegi<br>
Apki Furkhat Me Beti Kis Tarah Jeepayegi<br>
Yeh Dil Duhai Deta Hai Baba Bada Aandhera Hai<br>
<br>
2.Khoon Hai kaanou Se Zaari Aur Huthou Par Buka<br>
Derahi Hu Shaam Ke Is Qaid Khane Me Sada<br>
Har Gadhi Taza Musibat Har Gadhi Taza Jaafa<br>
Bedard Saari Duniya Hai Baba Bada Aandhera Hai<br>
<br>
3.Ab Howa Ehsas Mujh Ku Hai Yateemi Kya Bhala<br>
Mere Rone Par Hai Pheray Aur Matam Par Saza<br>
Shaam Ke Zindan Me Hu Zindagi Be aasra<br>
Har Dum Labou Pe Nouha Hai Baba Bada Aandhera Hai<br>
<br>
4.Aisa Lagta Yahan Par Saans Lena Zurm Hai<br>
Haaye Is Tanhai Se Bhi Baat Karna Zurm Hai<br>
Hadh Howi Ke Roushni Ka Bhi Guzarna Zurm Hai<br>
Dekho Sitam Yeh Kaisa Hai Baba Bada Aandhera Hai<br>
<br>
5.Zalimou Se Puchti Hai Kya Khata Mujhse Howi<br>
Bus Yehin Hai Zurm Mera Main Hu Beti Apki<br>
In Darindou Se Bachalu Warna Main Marjaungi<br>
Ek Khauf Mujhku Rehta Hai Baba Bada Aandhera Hai
